      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend Dr. Val and the veterinary staff, including technicians Natalia, Sam, and Alex, for their thorough explanations and bedside manner. Pet owners appreciate the team's attentive approach during checkups and treatments, though two visitors reported distressing appointments with critical diagnoses."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling across diverse species"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight the team's gentle treatment of pets, ranging from energetic dogs and cats to rabbits and bearded dragons. Clients appreciate that staff make anxious animals feel safe during nail trims, physical examinations, and post-surgical recovery."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Surgical care with mixed outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several pet parents praise successful surgical interventions and recoveries, including complex procedures on dogs and rabbits. However, two reviewers shared heartbreaking experiences involving severe kitten illness and unexpected pet loss, reflecting differing customer perspectives on difficult cases."
      }
    }
  ],
